{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-08-02", "prepared_on": "2026-08-02", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-08-02</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Europeans Are About to Find Out How Entrenched AI Is in Their Daily Lives<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">歐洲人即將發現 AI 已滲透日常生活到什麼程度</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">New EU rules require disclosure whenever people interact with AI or view AI-generated or edited content, sparking fears of \"disclosure fatigue.\"</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">歐盟新規要求業者告知使用者何時在與 AI 互動、或所見內容經 AI 生成或編輯，外界擔心恐引發「揭露疲勞」。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/europeans-are-about-to-find-out-how-entrenched-ai-is-in-their-daily-lives/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Judge Denies xAI's Request to Block Minnesota Ban on 'Nudify' Apps<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">法官駁回 xAI 訴請，明尼蘇達州「一鍵去衣」App 禁令得以續行</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Despite a lawsuit from xAI, Minnesota's ban on apps that let users \"nudify\" images can move forward.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">儘管 xAI 提起訴訟，明尼蘇達州禁止「一鍵去衣」App 的法規仍獲法官放行，將繼續執行。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/01/judge-denies-xais-request-to-block-minnesota-ban-on-nudify-apps/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Google Lets Gemini Spark Take Control of Chrome for Multi-Step Tasks<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google讓Gemini Spark操作Chrome，可代辦跨網站多步驟任務</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google is expanding Gemini Spark so the AI agent can operate within Chrome, using a user's logged-in accounts and saved passwords to handle tedious web tasks after consent.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google擴大Gemini Spark的開放範圍，讓這項AI代理功能與Chrome整合，在使用者同意後可利用已登入帳號與儲存密碼處理繁瑣的跨網站工作。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/177798\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Azure Cosmos DB Flaw Could Have Let Attackers Hijack Any Database Account<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Azure Cosmos DB漏洞曾可接管任意資料庫帳戶，私人網路隔離也可能失效</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Security firm Wiz disclosed a Cosmos DB vulnerability chain called CosmosEscape, which could let attackers break network isolation via crafted Gremlin queries and steal any account's primary access key.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">資安業者Wiz揭露名為CosmosEscape的Azure Cosmos DB漏洞鏈，攻擊者可用特製Gremlin查詢突破隔離環境，取得任意帳戶的主要存取金鑰。微軟已完成修補。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/177795\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Ten Advances in Mathematics and Theoretical Computer Science<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI公布數學與理論電腦科學十項新進展</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI shares new results on long-standing open problems in mathematics and theoretical computer science, including advances in geometry, cryptography, and complexity.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI發表在幾何、密碼學與複雜度理論等領域，針對長年懸而未解問題所獲得的十項新研究成果。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">OpenAI</b> · <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/ten-advances-in-mathematics\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Claude Published Malicious Code to the Internet and Attacked 3 Real Companies<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Claude將惡意程式碼發布到網路上，並攻擊了3家真實企業</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Had the hacks been carried out by conventional methods, someone would likely be facing prison time.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">若這些駭客攻擊是以傳統手法進行，恐怕早已有人因此入獄。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/security/2026/07/likely-illegally-claude-gained-access-to-3-networks-will-anthropic-be-held-to-account/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Google Nixes Its Earth AI Feature One Day After Launch<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google Earth AI功能上線僅一天便緊急下架，遭批評恐助長不實資訊</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A tool that let anyone generate fake AI imagery and superimpose it over real Google Earth maps quickly sparked backlash and was pulled.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">一項讓使用者以AI生成假影像並疊加在真實Google Earth地圖上的功能，因引發強烈反彈而迅速被下架。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/07/31/google-nixes-its-earth-ai-feature-one-day-after-launch-amid-criticism-it-would-spread-misinformation/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Siri AI Could Come With a Paywall for Power Users<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Siri AI恐向重度使用者收費</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Apple CEO Tim Cook envisions letting users buy more compute for Siri AI through Apple's existing iCloud+ subscriptions.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">蘋果執行長庫克設想讓使用者透過既有的iCloud+訂閱方案，額外購買Siri AI的運算資源。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/07/31/siri-ai-could-come-with-a-paywall-for-power-users/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Smallest.ai Raises $13M to Build Ultra-Fast Voice AI That Sounds Genuinely Human<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Smallest.ai籌得1,300萬美元，打造聽起來真人般的超快速語音AI</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The startup is building voice models designed to make AI phone calls convincing enough to pass the Turing test.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">這家新創公司正打造語音模型，目標是讓AI電話通話逼真到足以通過圖靈測試。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/07/31/smallest-ai-raises-13m-to-build-ultra-fast-voice-ai-that-sounds-genuinely-human/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Industry Veteran Kung Hua-chung Becomes Director of Taiwan's Cybersecurity Institute<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">產業出身接棒，龔化中8月1日就任第三任資安院院長一職</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Taiwan's National Institute of Cyber Security has appointed Kung Hua-chung, former QNAP CTO and CISO, as its new director effective August 1.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">國家資通安全研究院董事會拍板由前威聯通技術長暨資安長龔化中接任第三任院長，8月1日正式上任。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/177774\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}